From: ChopGimp <mathieu.redon@proton.me>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:12:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ChopGimp 3.29.2: fast vector objects (interactive drag moves
 the cached renderings and bounds, exact rendering, legacy path and
 objects-changed once at the end; layer growing keeps its pixels; undo keeps a
 copy of the object tree sharing the caches instead of its XML; XCF load does
 not draw the legacy path first; PDB drag-sim, bench-undo, bench-redo;
 CHOPGIMP_NO_FAST_DRAG, CHOPGIMP_NO_FAST_UNDO, CHOPGIMP_NO_FAST_LOAD)

